  i Awaiting a value that isn't a promise returns the same value, but still delays the code that follows it.
  
  i Remove await. To wait for several promises, pass them to Promise.all() instead.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  
  i Unsafe fix: Remove await.
  
    2 │ async·function·f1()·{·await·(<></>);·}
      │                       ------          

